-- expect-refusal: (counting): a rule concluding it is not range-restricted
-- a key the body does not bind: the idempotent twin is refused at load as a
-- lattice, and so is the counting tag, by name, not left to a shrug
edb(tcr_u).
tcr_u(a).
tag tcr_un(A, K, counting N).
tcr_un(A, K, K) :- tcr_u(A).
